  "title": "Perplexity AI Aims to Merge with TikTok U.S. in a Bold $50B Move",
  "summary": "Perplexity AI has announced an audacious merger proposal with TikTok U.S., a deal expected to be valued over $50 billion. This merger aims to leverage TikTok's extensive video content while addressing U.S. regulatory challenges. With the integration of AI search capabilities, the combined forces are set to revolutionize content discovery and potentially reshape the digital advertising landscape. However, the proposal requires ByteDance shareholder approval and faces significant regulatory scrutiny.",
